WEBVTT

00:01:41.370 --> 00:01:44.950
<i>D-R-E-A-M-E-R, Dreamer</i>

00:01:44.950 --> 00:01:52.290
<i>Clicking my heels on the pavement after the rain</i>

00:01:52.290 --> 00:01:59.410
<i>With light steps,</i>
<i>in high spirits, my heart leaps</i>

00:01:59.410 --> 00:02:07.250
<i>"Purely, delightfully, humorously"</i>

00:02:07.250 --> 00:02:08.750
<i>Wow oh Wow oh</i>

00:02:08.750 --> 00:02:15.330
<i>That's my motto</i>

00:02:15.330 --> 00:02:23.580
<i>If I'm going to move forward without</i>
<i>doing anything and break into pieces</i>

00:02:23.580 --> 00:02:29.830
<i>Then I'll go for broke, I won't look back</i>

00:02:29.830 --> 00:02:30.870
<i>Go! Go!</i>

00:02:30.870 --> 00:02:38.330
<i>If I just keep looking at it,</i>
<i>my dream will remain a dream</i>

00:02:38.330 --> 00:02:42.040
<i>I don't want to give up,</i>
<i>don't want to have regrets</i>

00:02:42.040 --> 00:02:47.790
<i>I don't know how, but it's not impossible</i>

00:02:47.790 --> 00:02:53.450
<i>I'm a Dreamer.</i>

00:02:52.160 --> 00:03:00.830
"STARMYU"

00:02:53.450 --> 00:02:57.750
<i>D-R-E-A-M-E-R, Dreamer</i>

00:03:00.830 --> 00:03:04.540
<i>D-R-E-A-M-E-R, Dreamer</i>

00:03:06.330 --> 00:03:09.160
This is Ayanagi Academy!

00:03:14.080 --> 00:03:19.080
"Act 1"

00:03:19.830 --> 00:03:24.620
"This is a work of fiction and is not related
to any existing persons, groups, or names."

00:03:29.370 --> 00:03:34.040
Here's fine. At this rate, you two'll be late...

00:03:34.040 --> 00:03:36.200
Well, see you later.

00:03:38.700 --> 00:03:41.910
"Popular Music Club"

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:41.910
Hey, have you decided what club you'll join yet?

00:03:41.910 --> 00:03:47.250
Move. Don't stand in front of me
acting so familiar, you boor.

00:03:51.330 --> 00:03:56.830
"Haruto Tsukigami | Musical King Edward"
"News flash! Performance this fall!"

00:03:57.290 --> 00:04:00.370
Hey, that's Haruto Tsukigami's...

00:04:00.370 --> 00:04:02.660
Oh, he is...?

00:04:18.700 --> 00:04:21.870
"Drama Club Accepting Applications"

00:04:19.500 --> 00:04:21.870
Excuse m... huh?

00:04:27.080 --> 00:04:28.370
Are you okay?

00:04:31.830 --> 00:04:34.410
Th-Thanks...

00:04:34.410 --> 00:04:37.660
You have an unusual name...
How do you pronounce it?

00:04:38.750 --> 00:04:42.410
It's "Nayuki"... "Toru Nayuki."

00:04:42.410 --> 00:04:46.500
Nayuki, huh? I'm Yuta Hoshitani.

00:04:46.500 --> 00:04:50.330
Hoshitani? You have an unusual name, too.

00:04:50.330 --> 00:04:51.750
I guess...

00:04:51.750 --> 00:04:53.040
Anyway, nice to meet you.

00:04:53.040 --> 00:04:55.700
Yeah, nice to meet you.

00:05:02.410 --> 00:05:03.830
Wh-What's that?

00:05:03.830 --> 00:05:05.000
It's the musical department.

00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:05.580
Hm?

00:05:05.580 --> 00:05:06.620
Their grand entrance...

00:05:06.620 --> 00:05:08.410
Wh-What should I do...?

00:05:08.410 --> 00:05:10.870
Nayuki, what's all the fuss about?

00:05:10.870 --> 00:05:13.120
Hoshitani, you don't know?

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:15.120
They're the third-year stars of Ayanagi Academy

00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:18.790
who reign as the top of
the musical department...

00:05:18.790 --> 00:05:21.410
They're the Kao Council!

00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:45.870
"Kao Council"

00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:45.870
The Kao Council...?

00:06:18.450 --> 00:06:25.000
♪ Sparkling, fluttering ♪

00:06:25.000 --> 00:06:31.200
♪ You're dazzled because of us ♪

00:06:31.830 --> 00:06:35.160
♪ Even our smiles charm ♪

00:06:35.160 --> 00:06:38.540
♪ A moment of temptation ♪

00:06:38.540 --> 00:06:41.040
♪ Brilliant! ♪

00:06:41.040 --> 00:06:45.450
♪ The prince you can meet now ♪

00:06:45.450 --> 00:06:52.120
♪ It's not magic or anything ♪

00:06:52.120 --> 00:06:57.000
♪ We're legendary because it's real ♪

00:06:57.000 --> 00:06:58.250
♪ Satisfy! ♪

00:06:58.250 --> 00:07:01.580
♪ Number one is right here ♪

00:07:01.580 --> 00:07:05.450
♪ The only one is this ♪

00:07:05.450 --> 00:07:11.790
♪ Shall we tell you what it means to be the best? ♪

00:07:11.790 --> 00:07:15.080
♪ Do you want to be number one? ♪

00:07:15.080 --> 00:07:19.080
♪ Do you want to be the only one? ♪

00:07:19.080 --> 00:07:22.500
♪ The whole world is astir ♪

00:07:22.500 --> 00:07:28.200
♪ We are Ayanagi Academy's... ♪

00:07:28.200 --> 00:07:33.120
♪ ...Kao Council ♪

00:07:41.830 --> 00:07:43.830
That emblem is...

00:07:51.080 --> 00:07:53.370
The musical department...

00:07:53.370 --> 00:07:56.540
Was that a department we could apply for?

00:07:56.540 --> 00:07:59.500
Hoshitani, you really don't know?!

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:00.620
Huh?

00:08:00.620 --> 00:08:02.200
Shh!

00:08:07.120 --> 00:08:09.540
To get into the musical department,

00:08:07.120 --> 00:08:12.250
New students, congratulations on your matriculation.

00:08:09.540 --> 00:08:12.250
you have to pass an entrance audition

00:08:12.250 --> 00:08:14.580
after you get into the school.

00:08:12.250 --> 00:08:14.580
Seeing you walk,

00:08:14.580 --> 00:08:16.290
"Entrance audition"?

00:08:14.580 --> 00:08:16.290
full of hope, under the cherry blossoms in full bloom,

00:08:16.290 --> 00:08:18.830
Yeah. It's customary for the Kao Council members

00:08:16.290 --> 00:08:21.660
reminds me of myself two years ago.

00:08:18.830 --> 00:08:21.660
to adjudicate them themselves

00:08:21.660 --> 00:08:23.040
Which means...

00:08:21.660 --> 00:08:24.620
In your new lives that you are about to begin,

00:08:23.040 --> 00:08:24.620
There's still time!

00:08:24.620 --> 00:08:26.000
not only my expectations, but...

00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:28.700
D-Don't tell me you're going to apply right now?

00:08:28.700 --> 00:08:31.040
"Musical Department Audition Application"

00:08:28.700 --> 00:08:29.790
Yeah!

00:08:29.790 --> 00:08:31.040
When did he...?

00:08:31.830 --> 00:08:34.540
But, but, it's really hard, you know.

00:08:34.540 --> 00:08:36.660
Nayuki, you're not gonna apply?

00:08:36.660 --> 00:08:39.830
Th-There's no way I'd make it...

00:08:40.290 --> 00:08:42.080
You don't know that.

00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:42.700
Huh?

00:08:42.700 --> 00:08:49.120
Before I decided to apply for Ayanagi Academy,
I'd only taken school music classes.

00:08:49.120 --> 00:08:51.500
But I'm here now.

00:08:51.500 --> 00:08:54.200
You won't know what'll happen unless you try.

00:08:54.200 --> 00:08:55.620
Right?

00:08:57.200 --> 00:09:01.000
Hoshitani, you're a little
different from other people, huh?

00:09:01.000 --> 00:09:03.700
In a good way!

00:09:03.700 --> 00:09:07.500
If it's him, I'm sure...

00:09:07.500 --> 00:09:09.540
So, Nayuki--

00:09:09.540 --> 00:09:12.500
When's the audition?

00:09:12.500 --> 00:09:13.830
It's right after this.

00:09:13.830 --> 00:09:15.080
Huh?

00:09:15.660 --> 00:09:17.120
Seriously...?

00:09:20.000 --> 00:09:23.000
"Tsubasa Hiragi | Sakuya Sazanami
Kyoji Akatsuki | C. Lion Yuzuriha | Itsuki Otori"

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:28.790
Now, how many will be coming this year?

00:09:29.830 --> 00:09:33.540
You're more interested than I expected, Otori.

00:09:33.540 --> 00:09:36.250
Oh hello, Prince Hiragi.

00:09:36.250 --> 00:09:39.160
Are you the one who ranked everyone?

00:09:39.160 --> 00:09:42.620
You're overly serious about work, as usual, huh?

00:09:42.620 --> 00:09:48.200
There will be many people coming,
so it is more efficient to sort them in advance.

00:09:48.200 --> 00:09:49.700
Nonsense!

00:09:49.700 --> 00:09:51.450
That's not beautiful.

00:09:52.660 --> 00:09:55.080
You wouldn't understand.

00:09:55.080 --> 00:09:59.080
The way the Kao Council does
things has never agreed with me.

00:09:59.080 --> 00:10:02.950
From today on, you are also
a member of that Kao Council--

00:10:02.950 --> 00:10:06.750
As the top star of the
newly established fifth team.

00:10:06.750 --> 00:10:09.080
I don't understand why, though.

00:10:09.080 --> 00:10:10.660
Why me?

00:10:10.660 --> 00:10:12.750
I've been a problem child since my first year,

00:10:12.750 --> 00:10:14.910
and I wasn't even on a Star Team--

00:10:14.910 --> 00:10:17.500
You failed on purpose, didn't you?

00:10:21.290 --> 00:10:23.830
This was decided by the chairman.

00:10:23.830 --> 00:10:25.370
I see.

00:10:25.370 --> 00:10:29.370
If it was what Grandfather decided,
then there's no helping it.

00:10:29.370 --> 00:10:35.040
Well, now that I'm here,
I'll be having fun with this in my own way.

00:10:35.870 --> 00:10:39.790
I don't know if I'll be able to live up
to your expectations, though.

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:52.540
"Musical Department Entrance Auditions"

00:10:56.330 --> 00:10:58.040
Take a deep breath.

00:11:02.160 --> 00:11:03.580
Let's go!

00:11:18.870 --> 00:11:21.540
All the students here are auditioning?

00:11:21.540 --> 00:11:26.910
There are a lot of students who are not from
the vocal music department that we're in, too.

00:11:26.910 --> 00:11:31.250
As expected of those in the star department.
All their eyes seem to be shining...

00:11:31.250 --> 00:11:32.660
"PR Club"

00:11:32.660 --> 00:11:34.750
Look, it's Kakeru Tengenji.

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:36.540
Huh?

00:11:36.540 --> 00:11:40.500
Tengenji? He's in our class, right...?

00:11:40.500 --> 00:11:44.000
He's wearing a kimono like a <i>kabuki</i> actor.

00:11:44.000 --> 00:11:46.410
Not "like"--He <i>is</i> a <i>kabuki</i> actor.

00:11:46.410 --> 00:11:47.700
What?!

00:11:47.700 --> 00:11:50.450
Haven't you heard of the
"young noble of the <i>kabuki</i> world"?

00:11:50.450 --> 00:11:52.370
Tengenji, may I take a picture?

00:11:52.370 --> 00:11:54.790
Of course not. Go through my agency.

00:11:54.790 --> 00:11:58.910
Early reviews say you're
a shoo-in for a Star Team?

00:11:58.910 --> 00:12:00.500
That's a silly question.

00:12:00.500 --> 00:12:03.750
If the Star Teams are the
top of Ayanagi Academy,

00:12:03.750 --> 00:12:07.250
then of course I will be there, you boor.

00:12:07.250 --> 00:12:09.580
Oh? Kaito Tsukigami!

00:12:11.370 --> 00:12:15.000
Tsukigami, did your brother say anything
about you getting admitted to Ayanagi Academy

00:12:15.000 --> 00:12:16.580
at the top of the class?

00:12:16.580 --> 00:12:17.580
No comment.

00:12:17.580 --> 00:12:20.700
Please, just one sentence, Tsukigami?

00:12:20.700 --> 00:12:22.290
Tengenji!

00:12:22.290 --> 00:12:23.120
Huh?!

00:12:23.120 --> 00:12:26.750
You're auditioning, too? Let's all work hard.

00:12:29.080 --> 00:12:35.540
I'm not someone commoners
like you can talk to so familiarly.

00:12:35.540 --> 00:12:39.450
Go be born again with more status, you boor.

00:12:39.450 --> 00:12:41.790
I wonder if Tengenji's nervous, too...

00:12:41.790 --> 00:12:45.910
I don't think that's it...
But I can't believe you talked to him.

00:12:45.910 --> 00:12:47.870
Well, he's our classmate!

00:12:47.870 --> 00:12:49.500
That's why?!

00:12:49.500 --> 00:12:52.950
More importantly, what was the "Star Team"
the PR club was talking about earlier?

00:12:52.950 --> 00:12:54.750
Oh, that's--

00:12:56.200 --> 00:13:00.040
We will now begin the entrance
auditions for the musical department.

00:13:00.040 --> 00:13:04.540
Those auditioning should quickly make
their way to their designated exam room.

00:13:07.580 --> 00:13:09.580
"Musical Department Entrance Auditions"
"Practical Skills Exam Room" "Singing"

00:13:13.750 --> 00:13:14.870
Okay, next.

00:13:14.870 --> 00:13:16.290
Yes, sir!

00:13:25.540 --> 00:13:27.450
Okay, next.

00:13:32.250 --> 00:13:34.250
"Toru Nayuki"

00:13:34.250 --> 00:13:36.250
"Musical Department Entrance Auditions"
"Practical Skills Exam Room" "Dancing"

00:13:44.410 --> 00:13:47.330
That's enough! Okay, next group.

00:13:47.330 --> 00:13:50.870
Wait, are you going
to audition in those clothes?

00:13:50.870 --> 00:13:54.620
Rather than worrying about me,
why don't you worry about the other guys?

00:13:54.620 --> 00:13:55.790
You boor.

00:13:55.790 --> 00:13:56.870
Huh?

00:13:56.870 --> 00:14:02.750
The famous Ayanagi Academy? What a laugh.

00:14:02.750 --> 00:14:03.620
"Kakeru Tengenji"

00:14:03.620 --> 00:14:04.450
"Musical Department Entrance Auditions"
"Practical Skills Exam Room" "Acting"

00:14:04.450 --> 00:14:06.000
Please accept it!

00:14:06.000 --> 00:14:07.790
I am not here to argue!

00:14:07.790 --> 00:14:11.000
Then I will leave! I will--

00:14:11.000 --> 00:14:12.830
Okay, that's enough.

00:14:13.580 --> 00:14:15.950
Thank you very much.

00:14:15.950 --> 00:14:18.000
One no show, huh?

00:14:18.660 --> 00:14:20.660
"Shu Kuga"

00:14:22.790 --> 00:14:25.120
Last is the interview, right?

00:14:25.120 --> 00:14:27.790
Nayuki and I were split up halfway through,

00:14:27.790 --> 00:14:29.450
but I hope he's okay.

00:14:35.120 --> 00:14:36.120
Sorry.

00:14:36.120 --> 00:14:38.830
Oh, yeah, me too.

00:14:38.830 --> 00:14:40.200
Later.

00:14:41.200 --> 00:14:44.830
Hey, that part is already over--

00:14:44.830 --> 00:14:47.330
Oh, shoot! The interview!

00:14:50.620 --> 00:14:52.830
It has nothing to do with it!

00:14:56.200 --> 00:14:58.000
Next, Yuta Hoshitani.

00:14:59.370 --> 00:15:00.200
C-Coming!

00:15:00.200 --> 00:15:01.700
"Kaito Tsukigami"

00:15:06.120 --> 00:15:08.120
This way, please.

00:15:08.120 --> 00:15:09.830
Yes, sir.

00:15:17.450 --> 00:15:20.950
"Yuta Hoshitani | Vocal | D | fail"

00:15:22.250 --> 00:15:24.660
Is there anything you would like to say?

00:15:24.660 --> 00:15:27.040
U-Um...

00:15:27.040 --> 00:15:28.750
'Scuse me!

00:15:28.750 --> 00:15:31.120
Did you find a Star candidate?

00:15:31.790 --> 00:15:33.660
Otori...

00:15:36.370 --> 00:15:38.370
Sorry. Please continue.

00:15:41.040 --> 00:15:42.450
What's the matter?

00:15:42.450 --> 00:15:44.620
Oh, um...

00:15:44.620 --> 00:15:46.250
What's wrong, boy?

00:15:46.250 --> 00:15:51.040
If you sell yourself well enough here,
you might be able to join a Star Team, you know.

00:15:51.040 --> 00:15:53.160
"Star Team"...?

00:15:53.160 --> 00:15:54.700
Um, that's...?

00:15:54.700 --> 00:15:56.120
You don't know?

00:15:56.120 --> 00:15:59.870
We, the members of the Kao Council,

00:15:59.870 --> 00:16:02.540
choose from those who pass the
musical department entrance auditions

00:16:02.540 --> 00:16:06.160
to create five special teams that will receive
guidance from us, nicknamed the Star Teams.

00:16:06.160 --> 00:16:10.000
If you're chosen, it will make a big difference
in your grades for the next three years.

00:16:10.000 --> 00:16:13.500
That's how it is, so it's
your loss if you keep quiet.

00:16:13.500 --> 00:16:17.500
You should show off what
you're good at, or what you like.

00:16:17.500 --> 00:16:21.450
Show off... what I like...?

00:16:48.000 --> 00:16:49.870
Excuse me.

00:16:49.870 --> 00:16:52.080
The practical skills exams are over.

00:16:52.080 --> 00:16:55.040
If you have nothing more
to say, then you may leave.

00:17:05.870 --> 00:17:09.540
I couldn't do it like that high schooler at all.

00:17:09.540 --> 00:17:12.910
Even though I finally made
it into the same school as him...

00:17:14.950 --> 00:17:17.500
I want to dance...

00:17:17.500 --> 00:17:19.790
...that dance.

00:17:21.500 --> 00:17:25.330
♪ Stride of a star ♪

00:17:25.330 --> 00:17:29.370
♪ The first step of the beginning ♪

00:17:29.370 --> 00:17:33.750
♪ I'll make tomorrow's smile shine ♪

00:17:33.750 --> 00:17:40.450
♪ So that it'll reach that dazzling place ♪

00:17:56.450 --> 00:17:58.370
♪ I won't give up ♪

00:17:58.370 --> 00:18:02.040
♪ I'll even use the pain ♪

00:18:02.040 --> 00:18:03.620
♪ Do my best! ♪

00:18:03.620 --> 00:18:09.120
♪ I'll place my bets on a
possibility that's not zero ♪

00:18:09.120 --> 00:18:10.410
♪ Let's go together now! ♪

00:18:10.410 --> 00:18:17.870
♪ When light shone on my too-average days ♪

00:18:17.870 --> 00:18:24.580
♪ I'll take the steps I decided in my heart ♪

00:18:24.580 --> 00:18:28.700
♪ To the new world ♪

00:18:28.700 --> 00:18:30.410
♪ Believe in myself! ♪

00:18:30.410 --> 00:18:37.290
♪ Even if I stumble, my toes are facing forward ♪

00:18:37.290 --> 00:18:40.750
♪ Even when I reflect on it, I don't regret it ♪

00:18:40.750 --> 00:18:44.660
♪ My heart's beating faster, infinitely ♪

00:18:44.660 --> 00:18:48.200
♪ Stride of a star ♪

00:18:48.200 --> 00:18:55.120
♪ Admiration draws the map of courage ♪

00:18:55.120 --> 00:18:59.040
♪ That leads me to the future ♪

00:18:59.040 --> 00:19:08.370
♪ The twinkling of my heart
is released into the sky ♪

00:19:30.290 --> 00:19:31.950
This is the room, huh?

00:19:33.290 --> 00:19:33.910
Excuse me--

00:19:33.910 --> 00:19:35.450
Huh?

00:19:35.450 --> 00:19:37.370
--Nayuki?
--Hoshitani?

00:19:37.910 --> 00:19:38.750
Here.

00:19:38.750 --> 00:19:40.290
Thanks.

00:19:40.290 --> 00:19:43.330
I didn't think I'd be sharing
a room with you, Nayuki.

00:19:43.950 --> 00:19:44.950
It's lukewarm...

00:19:44.950 --> 00:19:47.660
Hot drinks are not good for your throat.

00:19:47.660 --> 00:19:49.620
I see.

00:19:49.620 --> 00:19:53.200
Oh right, Nayuki. How was the audition?

00:19:55.200 --> 00:19:58.500
I... don't think I made it...

00:20:00.370 --> 00:20:04.330
You know, I have extreme stage fright.

00:20:04.330 --> 00:20:08.250
Ever since I was little, I've always been
really bad during the actual performance.

00:20:09.200 --> 00:20:14.700
The harder I try, the more my knees shake.

00:20:14.700 --> 00:20:18.950
I always mess up when it's important.

00:20:19.540 --> 00:20:22.950
I thought I'd try to bring it under
control a little before starting school,

00:20:22.950 --> 00:20:26.950
so I tried some stuff at home with
help from my little sisters, though...

00:20:26.950 --> 00:20:29.700
Sorry, I forced you to do it with me.

00:20:29.700 --> 00:20:33.410
No, sorry, I didn't mean to make you feel bad.

00:20:33.410 --> 00:20:35.830
How did you do, Hoshitani?

00:20:36.580 --> 00:20:40.790
I felt like I still had a long way to go.

00:20:40.790 --> 00:20:42.410
S-Sorry...

00:20:42.410 --> 00:20:46.040
No, I meant that I'm glad I figured that out.

00:20:46.040 --> 00:20:48.040
Gotta work harder from now on!

00:20:48.040 --> 00:20:49.750
Right?

00:20:49.750 --> 00:20:51.450
Hoshitani...

00:20:51.450 --> 00:20:54.450
Besides, it's not like I've given up.

00:20:54.450 --> 00:20:58.580
The results haven't been announced yet,
so we don't know what'll happen!

00:20:58.580 --> 00:21:02.120
That's why it's too early for you
to be depressed, too, Nayuki!

00:21:02.950 --> 00:21:04.160
You're right.

00:21:04.160 --> 00:21:05.450
You're right!

00:21:08.120 --> 00:21:11.950
If we really don't make it,
we can have a pity party together!

00:21:18.660 --> 00:21:20.080
Hm? What's wrong, Nayuki?

00:21:20.080 --> 00:21:23.500
Oh, it's nothing.

00:21:29.870 --> 00:21:31.410
That's great.

00:22:12.870 --> 00:22:20.040
<i>Someday, when you're crushed by your dreams</i>

00:22:20.040 --> 00:22:26.580
<i>On a night when you look up at a starless sky</i>

00:22:26.580 --> 00:22:30.080
<i>Just remember (today)</i>

00:22:30.080 --> 00:22:34.370
<i>The days we ran like crazy (together)</i>

00:22:34.370 --> 00:22:38.500
<i>Those steps were miracles</i>

00:22:38.500 --> 00:22:41.750
<i>Ring out, Countdown!</i>

00:22:41.750 --> 00:22:45.330
<i>Taking off for the future from here</i>

00:22:45.330 --> 00:22:49.290
<i>You will start singing again</i>

00:22:49.290 --> 00:22:52.450
<i>There are things you lack</i>

00:22:52.450 --> 00:22:56.330
<i>So you reach out desperately to grab them</i>

00:22:56.330 --> 00:22:59.830
<i>These hot, passionate feelings overflowing</i>

00:22:59.830 --> 00:23:03.580
<i>Make the light of the stars your ally</i>

00:23:03.580 --> 00:23:07.160
<i>Even bluffing can become your pride</i>

00:23:07.160 --> 00:23:10.830
<i>You can fly however you want</i>

00:23:10.830 --> 00:23:16.830
<i>Everything starts now!</i>

00:23:32.410 --> 00:23:35.120
H-Hoshitani...

00:23:35.120 --> 00:23:36.500
Seriously?

00:23:36.500 --> 00:23:37.660
"Star Team (team Otori)" "Class A Kakeru Tengenji"
"Class A Toru Nayuki" "Class A Yuta Hoshitani"

00:23:37.660 --> 00:23:39.450
"Class B Shu Kuga" "Class B Kaito Tsukigami"

00:23:45.410 --> 00:23:48.500
We passed... On top of that...

00:23:48.500 --> 00:23:50.370
We're on a Star Team...?

00:23:56.540 --> 00:23:59.450
"Act 2"

00:23:57.290 --> 00:23:59.450
Nayuki, do you know where my t-shirt is?

00:23:59.450 --> 00:24:00.660
Here, I folded it for you.

00:24:00.660 --> 00:24:01.660
Thanks! Um, my socks are...

00:24:01.660 --> 00:24:03.450
"Ayanagi Academy Murder Case" "Act 4"

00:24:01.660 --> 00:24:03.450
Thanks! Um, my socks are...

00:24:03.450 --> 00:24:04.910
Here. I darned them.

00:24:04.910 --> 00:24:07.870
And your toothbrush was
getting old, so I bought a new one.

00:24:07.870 --> 00:24:10.080
Nayuki's like my mom...

00:24:11.290 --> 00:24:18.370
"You'll watch again, right?"
